; ===============================================================
;  Quad alignment-tolerance study
;  4-cell FODO with σ_dx = σ_dy = 0.20 mm random offsets on every
;  quadrupole (Gaussian, 3σ truncated).  Apply 100+ seeds and watch
;  the centroid and σ_x ensemble fan out.
;
;  TraceWin ERROR_QUAD_NCPL_STAT applies to the next N=8 quads of
;  the same family — covers all 8 below.
; ===============================================================
TITLE Quad alignment tolerance
FREQ 325
PARTRAN_STEP 100 50
;
; --- Misalignment directive: applies to the next 8 QUADs ---
;     N  r  dx   dy   φx φy φz  dG dG3 dG4 dG5 dG6
ERROR_QUAD_NCPL_STAT 8 2 0.2 0.2 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
;
; --- 4-period FODO ---
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 100 8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 -8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 -8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 -8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 250 20
QUAD 100 -8 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 200 20
END
